OL,3,AEcuador intelligence chief and five
OL,4,AAmericans killed in Kenya helicopter
OL,5,Acrash
OL,6,
OL,7,FEcuador's intelligence chief and his
OL,8,Fwife have been killed in a helicopter
OL,9,Fcrash in Kenya.
OL,11,FMichele Sensi-Contugi and his wife
OL,12,FStephany Hollihan were among the seven
OL,13,Fpeople killed when the accident
OL,14,Fhappened in Samburu county at
OL,15,Fapproximately 09:13 (06:13 GMT) on
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,18,FThe other five victims were Americans,
OL,19,Fa US State Department spokesperson
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
