OL,3,AEcuador intelligence chief and five
OL,4,AAmericans killed in Kenya helicopter
OL,5,Acrash
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Kenya Civil Aviation Authority
OL,8,F(KCAA) said the helicopter was on a
OL,9,Fscenic flight from a wildlife
OL,10,Fconservancy in Loisaba to Ewaso Nyiro,
OL,11,Fa river that flows along several
OL,12,Fnational reserves.
